mg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/b793506f485f7aea33e9a8f9b7662cca.poster.avif?t=1786296555\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/b793506f485f7aea33e9a8f9b7662cca.webm?t=1786296555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/b793506f485f7aea33e9a8f9b7662cca.mp4?t=1786296555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maintain Your Workplace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the mail (and the blood) flowing with magical artifacts, and ancient tools. Despite residing in the dark domain, you should still keep a tidy workspace. Let the equipment fall into disarray at your own peril. If the mail stops, your heart might just be next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/2e566b1f6e22b0e10b2343b4b1fcb689.poster.avif?t=1786296555\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/2e566b1f6e22b0e10b2343b4b1fcb689.webm?t=1786296555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965430/extras/2e566b1f6e22b0e10b2343b4b1fcb689.mp4?t=1786296555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Only Way Out Is Through</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of your surroundings and find your way to hell’s exit before you’re trapped for eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l